            "notes": "**Decision**\nDo they have hard Blockable CC?\n\nIf Yes, [Shield Stampede](item_0c4ef690-6472-48fe-9257-864c4381f584)\nElse, [Vanguard](item_228cf103-0be8-4f1c-8780-f3a8d8676abf)\n\nYes = ONE OF [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d), [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85)\n\nDon't force yourself to play around CC, just take [Shield Stampede](item_0c4ef690-6472-48fe-9257-864c4381f584)\n\nThese Items are basically mandatory, play Standard Rein and swing when you can.",
