            "notes": "**Decision**\nCan we Swing!? If so, will we be punished?\n\n- [x] They have ground heroes - there are targets that post charge I can swing.\n- [x] I don't have to shield and kite immediately after engage.\n\nIf Yes, [Dampener Grip](item_451f8c81-1821-48a4-a980-ae1cebd61a85) & [Blazing Blitz](item_6dd5ba0e-fe32-4128-9f34-4ce8619237b7)\n\nThe second question is very key here, some matchups make it unfavourable for you to prioritise swinging:\n[Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) & [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) & [Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399)\n[Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457)\n[Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b) \n[Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) & [Melee Damage](stat_melee_damage)\n[Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) & [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)\n\nIf you're caught swinging you're done for. You have to kite and you have to play range. \n\n**I CAN SWING**\nHere, [Blazing Blitz](item_6dd5ba0e-fe32-4128-9f34-4ce8619237b7) & [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) enable a strong ultimate even when Earth Shatter is blocked. Without Attack Speed (from [Dampener Grip](item_451f8c81-1821-48a4-a980-ae1cebd61a85) ), Blazing Blitz doesn't provide enough value. \n\n**I CAN'T SWING**\nInvest in Fire Strike damage, [Impact Burst](item_01fa37d8-4355-4ec2-a9af-59bf030e2882) > [Magma Strike](item_6d8d893f-d161-4e10-a084-4a5749b12990) as it helps secure kills. However, if you're facing a grouped up comp, coom may be the pref option.\n\n**I CAN'T SWING & I CAN'T HIT A FS**\nSometimes you're useless, all in on the charge and supplement with utility & sustain. [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f) & [Vanguard](item_228cf103-0be8-4f1c-8780-f3a8d8676abf). Try to be less useless.\n\n\nItem Priority follows:\nAP\nCDR\n\nTherefore, [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) & [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) are prio.\n\n**Do the math**\n14k = 35% AP [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce)\n10.5k = 35% AP + 5% CDR [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) & [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n\n10-13k spare is an awkward place, **DON'T DEFAULT INTO AN EPIC** Blues are your friend!\n\n12k = 30% AP + 10% CDR [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) & [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\nOR\n12,250 = 30% AP + 5% CDR + 10% ALS + 5% AD + 20 HP [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) & [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) & [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)",
